{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台清晨一度發出紅色暴雨警告信號，生效約四小時。教育局宣布，所有上午校及全日制學校今日停課。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">早上大部分地區的雨量約50毫米，東部地區更超過100毫米。西貢有道路出現嚴重水浸，有車輛拋錨。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.RAIN-1000.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026GUmhoiBZB91787796442.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.RAIN-1000.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台在凌晨零時和四時半兩度發出黃色暴雨警告，到凌晨約5時改發紅雨警告。教育局宣布，所有上午校及全日制學校今日停課。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.RAIN-1000_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026xxVedHMA9L1787796434.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.RAIN-1000_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台到早上9時20分再改發黃色暴雨警告，約一小時後取消。預測今日初時有大驟雨及狂風雷暴，稍後驟雨逐漸減少。明日及星期六有幾陣驟雨，日間酷熱。隨後一兩日天氣不穩定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T02:59:47.272469+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}